/S /P
/P 561 0 R
/E (The objective of this study is to formulate an NMPC to autonomously navigate the high-speed 130R corner at Suzuka Circuit. The vehicle plant features continuous active aerodynamics, requiring the controller to simultaneously optimize steering, throttle, and the front and rear wing Angles of Attack \(AoA\). )
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [5]
>>
